			old: [
				"A &agreat world&f where the only limit is your imagination."
				""
				"Explore the &2deepest caves&f or the highest &bskies&f, build machines to do tasks for you, or invent a new &5magic spell&f."
				""
				"Discover new &ddimensions&f and the species that inhabit each &abiome&f."
				""
				"But this world holds more than adventure. Ancient powers have left their mark upon it."
				""
				"Among them are the mysterious &5Oathbound Relics&f - artifacts bound to those willing to endure their curse. Once equipped, an Oathbound Relic &cbinds permanently&f and persists even through death."
				""
				"The &5Oathbound Relic&f grants powerful blessings to its bearer, but every blessing comes with a price. The &cBranded&f must endure deadly curses before they can awaken the relic's true potential."
				""
				"&7Fortune of Blood. Earthly Favor. Soul Harvest. Arcane Attunement. Bloodlust. Last Rite.&f"
				""
				"Each blessing brings greater power, but only those strong enough to survive their &cOath&f will receive it."
				""
				"Only those who bear the Relic may awaken the &5Oathbound artifacts&f scattered throughout Craftoria."
				""
				"The course of this &aworld&f lies solely in your hands."
